const faqs = [
	{
		question: 'How many Christians are there in Ukraine?',
		answer:
			'Most Ukrainians are Christian. In the Razumkov Centre\'s November 2025 survey of 2,009 adults in government-controlled areas, 58% said they are Orthodox, about 12% Greek Catholic, 3% Protestant, 1% Roman Catholic and 10% simply "Christian" — roughly 84% together — while 15.5% said they have no religion. The survey could not cover areas of active hostilities. You can read the Scriptures they treasure free at fathersheartbible.com/read.',
	},
	{
		question: 'Can I read the Bible online free in Ukrainian?',
		answer:
			"Yes. Father's Heart Bible™ is free to read and hear online in Ukrainian — all 66 books, no account, no purchase, no app — at fathersheartbible.com/read/uk/. The English edition is free too.",
	},
	{
		question: 'What was the first Bible printed in Ukraine?',
		answer:
			'The Ostrog Bible, printed by Ivan Fedorov at Ostrog in 1580-1581, was the first complete printed Bible in Church Slavonic and the first Bible printed in Cyrillic type. It was not in modern Ukrainian: the first complete Bible in modern Ukrainian, begun by Panteleimon Kulish and finished by Ivan Puluj and Ivan Nechuy-Levytsky, was published in Vienna in 1903.',
	},
	{
		question: 'What is the Peresopnytsia Gospel?',
		answer:
			"It is a manuscript of the Gospels written between 1556 and 1561 in Ruthenian, the earliest known translation of the canonical Scriptures into the language of the people. UNESCO inscribed it in Memory of the World in 2005, and Ukraine's presidents have taken their oath of office on it since 1991.",
	},
	{
		question: 'Which Ukrainian Bible translations are most used?',
		answer:
			"Several are in use. Ivan Ohiienko's translation (completed 1940, published 1962) is widely used among Orthodox and Protestant readers, and the Ukrainian Bible Society commissioned a newer translation by Rafail Turkoniak, worked on from 1997 to 2007. The older Kulish text, from 1903, is written in a dialect that many modern readers find hard.",
	},
	{
		question: "Is Father's Heart Bible available in Ukrainian?",
