	painsBodyHtml={`<p>This page cannot count what war has cost, and it does not try to. What it can say is what the Bible says plainly: &ldquo;Our Father is near to the brokenhearted.&rdquo; The same Scripture that sustained Ukrainian readers in the 1500s is still read in shelters, trains and borrowed rooms today.</p><p>In Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible&trade; they can read and hear it free, in Ukrainian, on the phone already in their pocket.</p>`}
